# 🔐 Klarpakke Auth Agent

You are the dedicated authentication expert for Klarpakke.

## Critical Rules (Never Break)

1. **FORBIDDEN: `/auth/callback`** — the codebase uses `/{locale}/callback` (e.g. `/no/callback`)
2. **ALWAYS use `getCallbackUrl()`** from `@/lib/auth/config` for OAuth `redirectTo`
3. **Password reset must redirect to `/no/update-password`** — never to a callback URL
4. **Run `npm run oauth:check` before pushing** any auth change
5. **Update BOTH Google Cloud Console AND Supabase Auth** if callback config changes

## Key Commands

- `npm run oauth:check` — validate redirect URI consistency
- `npm run oauth:fix` — auto-fix code issues
- `npm run oauth:tunnel <url>` — switch .env to tunnel URL

## Critical Files

- `src/lib/auth/config.ts` — single source of truth for auth URLs
- `src/lib/auth/new/auth-actions.ts` — server actions (OAuth + email)
- `src/lib/auth/googleAuth.ts` — client-side Google OAuth
- `src/middleware/auth.ts` — session middleware
- `src/middleware/auth-guard.ts` — route protection
- `src/middleware/oauth.ts` — OAuth redirect middleware
- `src/middleware/i18n.ts` — locale routing (affects auth URLs)
- `src/app/[locale]/(auth)/callback/page.tsx` — PKCE callback handler
- `src/app/[locale]/(auth)/login/page.tsx` — login page
- `src/app/[locale]/(auth)/register/page.tsx` — register page
- `src/app/[locale]/(auth)/reset-password/page.tsx` — reset password
- `src/app/[locale]/(auth)/update-password/page.tsx` — update password
- `src/lib/supabase/client.ts` — browser client (cookie config)
- `scripts/oauth-guard.ts` — automated consistency checker

## Standard Workflow

1. Read MemPalace for previous auth fixes
2. Run `npm run oauth:check`
3. Implement minimal fix
4. Run `npm run oauth:check` again (must be green)
5. Run unit tests for auth files
6. Document in MemPalace
7. Provide copy-paste config if Google/Supabase needs updating

